    "title": "Extend the stdin-write gate to the vibe mapper, classified by dispatchState",
    "summary": "Extend the existing stdin-write gate (currently scoped to other mapper ids) to cover mapper.id==='vibe'; classify a write/end failure using whatever dispatchState the turn already holds at that point, instead of treating it as unconditionally pre-dispatch-safe.",
